        " بَطْنِ أُمِّهِ فَقَالَ «إِنَّ اَللَّهَ تَبَارَكَ وتَعَالَى حَبَسَ عَلَيْهِ اَلْحَيْضَةَ فَجَعَلَهَا رِزْقَهُ فِي بَطْنِ أُمِّهِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.197 – Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) narrates:\nSalman al-Farsi (may Allah (swt) have mercy on him) asked Amir al-Mu'minin (as) about the sustenance of the child in its mother's womb.\nImam (as) said: 'Indeed, Allah (swt), Blessed and Exalted, has reserved the menstrual period for it and made it its sustenance in its mother's womb.'"
        ]
      }
